  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Figure 3, 'Continuity of Care scenario': the vaccine is administered, the core data set is recorded on the DDCC paper certificate, and the record is then made available in digital form. Four lanes: subject of care, vaccinator, data entry personnel, DDCC holder. (1) The subject of care arrives at the care site; (2) the vaccinator vaccinates and (3) records core data set elements on a paper certificate, which the holder receives as Point A, a paper record of DDCC:VS. Is there a digital health solution at the care site? If no, (5) data entry personnel record the elements in a digital health solution. If yes, (4) the vaccinator records them in one; then, does the care site have Internet connectivity? Yes leads directly, and no via step 5, to Point B: the record of vaccination status is available in a digital form. End.",
      "state": "draft",
